#. ~ Snippet of item "rifle-cartridge necklace"
#: data/json/items/armor/jewelry.json
msgid ""
"Rather crude and clearly put together on a budget, this is a piece of post-"
"Cataclysmic—so-called—jewelry—little more than an unpolished, solitary rifle "
"casing threaded on a length of cord, string, or twine to form a pendent "
"necklace.  The primer's indented portion has been drilled away, with a second"
" hole situated in the casing's side just shy of the base and a length of "
"tied-off cordage looping through both entry points to form a makeshift chain "
"for the apparel."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet of item "rifle-cartridge necklace"
