"An expedient means of flaunting one's gunnery prowess, or a crude attempt at "
"overcompensating for matters best left undescribed, this article of craft-"
"produced jewelry is, essentially, one part cordage and three parts mammoth "
"bullet casing: the giant cartridge, either from a grenade round or some other"
" form of heavy munitions, strung to hang upon the chest as a pendent."
